"authors, skip posts with <strong>Post Offset</strong>, target exact posts "
"with <strong>Include/Exclude Posts</strong>, and control the number and "
"order of posts. Then pick a <strong>Load More / Pagination</strong> type to "
"split long lists across pages."
msgstr ""

