#: src/admin/utils/data.js:122
msgid ""
"Use the <strong>Elements</strong> tab to toggle and reorder post content "
"(image, title, meta, excerpt, read more), then the <strong>Style</strong> "
"tab to set colors, typography, borders, and hover effects. Publish when "
"ready."
